{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20022","headline":"上河阳李大夫 · 孟郊","name":"上河阳李大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上将秉神略，至兵无猛威。\n三军当严冬，一抚胜重衣。\n霜劒夺衆景，夜星失长辉。\n苍鹰独立时，恶鸟不敢飞。\n武牢锁天关，河桥纽地机。\n大将奚以安，守此称者稀。\n贫士少颜色，贵门多轻肥。\n试登山岳高，方见草木微。\n山岳恩既广，草木心皆归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}